# Secrets of the AI features. Copy to ai.env and lock it like db.env: only the app container
# reads it, and it never belongs in the app folder (a clone of the public repository).
#
# LINGO_SECRET_KEY encrypts every learner's AI keys (AES-256-GCM). It is the base64 of 32
# random bytes, made for example with
#   docker run --rm node:24.22.1-alpine3.24 node -e "console.log(require('crypto').randomBytes(32).toString('base64'))"
# Keep a copy with the database backups. Without it the saved keys cannot be decrypted, and
# every learner has to enter their keys again.
LINGO_SECRET_KEY=

# Voice through the workstation (deploy/voice/README.md). Leave both lines out until the voice
# stack runs; without them the app shows no voice controls beyond the browser's own voice.
# VOICE_URL is the gateway as the app reaches it, the workstation's reserved local network
# address and the gateway's port. VOICE_TOKEN is the long random token from the voice stack's
# .env file (the same value).
# VOICE_URL=https://192.0.2.10:8443
# VOICE_TOKEN=
#
# Optional. The default voice, and the Whisper model if you changed it in the voice stack.
# VOICE_DEFAULT_VOICE=af_heart
# VOICE_STT_MODEL=Systran/faster-whisper-small
